--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9c94e8900bdbef942ad19f626cdac685, type: 3}
  m_Name: Horizontal_Scene5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sceneHeader: Scene 5
  sceneSubHeader: Maturation and Assembly
  NarrationBeats:
  - narrationText: "While insulin vesicles travel from the Golgi to the beta cell
      membrane, an intricate microcosm of maturation and packing processes happens
      inside. \r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: 24761914
        Data2: 1108328348
        Data3: -420045137
        Data4: -426824488
      Path: event:/VO/scene_05_01
  - narrationText: "This transforms the proinsulin into packaged insulin.\r\r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: 1881810023
        Data2: 1132243177
        Data3: 2099012515
        Data4: -636025563
      Path: event:/VO/scene_05_02
  - narrationText: "First, the fluid environment inside the vesicle gradually acidifies
      as protons are steadily pumped into it. \r\r\r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: 213242083
        Data2: 1322087771
        Data3: -2134541171
        Data4: 1564477009
      Path: event:/VO/scene_05_03
  - narrationText: "This acidity rouses enzymes inside the vesicle.\r \r\r\r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: 1445216959
        Data2: 1087677373
        Data3: 541487283
        Data4: -234677388
      Path: event:/VO/scene_05_04
  - narrationText: "These enzymes snip away parts of the proinsulin, leaving behind
      insulin peptides that shape themselves into basic units called monomers.\r\r
      \r\r\r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: -545778682
        Data2: 1207877359
        Data3: 1420155301
        Data4: 902983365
      Path: event:/VO/scene_05_05
  - narrationText: "As more and more enzymes trim proinsulin into insulin monomers,
      the concentration of insulin within the vesicle steadily rises.\r\r\r \r\r\r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: 206490409
        Data2: 1271586084
        Data3: 47226004
        Data4: -1781532204
      Path: event:/VO/scene_05_06
  - narrationText: "When the concentration becomes high enough, the monomers start
      binding together: first forming pairs called dimers, then into assemblies called
      hexamers. \r\r\r\r \r\r\r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: 1521590709
        Data2: 1296449530
        Data3: -2070623100
        Data4: -270215465
      Path: event:/VO/scene_05_07
  - narrationText: "Clusters of insulin hexamers then begin to tile together in structured
      and ordered patterns, manifesting throughout the interior of the vesicle as
      tiny crystals.\r. \r\r\r\r \r\r\r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: -66170223
        Data2: 1278185604
        Data3: -1408779372
        Data4: -206266257
      Path: event:/VO/scene_05_08
  - narrationText: "Finally, these smaller insulin crystals coalesce together into
      one grand rhomboid monolith: a full insulin crystal, just as the insulin vesicle
      nears maturation.\r\r. \r\r\r\r \r\r\r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: -602741108
        Data2: 1189023334
        Data3: -2038006373
        Data4: -794880334
      Path: event:/VO/scene_05_09
  - narrationText: "When insulin vesicles have fully matured, they at last reach
      the end of their migration and dock themselves underneath the cell\u2019s membrane.\r\r\r.
      \r\r\r\r \r\r\r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: -577032999
        Data2: 1119431088
        Data3: -1455462746
        Data4: 1479701598
      Path: event:/VO/scene_05_10
  - narrationText: "Here, the new batch of insulin waits patiently, until the next
      round of signaling releases them to their destiny.\r\n\r\r\r. \r\r\r\r \r\r\r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: -416979384
        Data2: 1280442955
        Data3: 431268782
        Data4: -1694771435
      Path: event:/VO/scene_05_11
